# Core Java → Annotations → Level 2 (Difficult)

## Advanced Annotation Semantics
* How does the Java compiler represent annotations in class files?
* How are runtime-visible and runtime-invisible annotations represented in bytecode?
* What is the relationship between annotation retention and class-file attributes?
* How do annotations on inherited classes differ from annotations declared directly on a subclass?
* How does `@Inherited` behave when a subclass declares the same annotation explicitly?
* How do annotations behave when a class implements multiple interfaces containing annotated methods?
* Are annotations automatically inherited when a method is overridden?
* How do bridge methods and compiler-generated methods affect annotation inspection?
* What challenges arise when retrieving annotations from generic types?
* How do type-use annotations differ from declaration annotations at the bytecode level?

